{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/PaywallViewController"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A view controller protocol used by the SDK to present paywalls when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accessing restricted content.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/PaywallViewController\/onDismiss"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/objc(cs)UIViewController"],"title":"Inherits From"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallViewController"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIViewController","text":"UIViewController"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/Paywall-Integration"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement this protocol in a custom view controller that presents your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall or subscription UI. The SDK presents the view controller modally"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but does not dismiss it — the view controller owns its own dismissal and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation style.